    <!-- Header -->
    <header>
        <div class="container">
            <div class="header-content">
                <div class="logo">
                    <div class="logo-icon">CS</div>
                    <div class="logo-text">CS:GO</div>
                </div>
                <nav>
                    <ul>
                        <li><a href="#home">Home</a></li>
                        <li><a href="#weapons">Weapons</a></li>
                        <li><a href="#maps">Maps</a></li>
                        <li><a href="#pros">Pro Scene</a></li>
                        <li><a href="#news">News</a></li>
                    </ul>
                </nav>
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <section class="hero" id="home">
        <div class="hero-content">
            <h1>Counter-Strike 2</h1>
            <p>The definitive tactical first-person shooter. Precision, teamwork, and strategy define every round.</p>
            <a href="https://blog.counter-strike.net/" target="_blank" class="btn">Visit Official Site</a>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Features Section -->
    <section>
        <div class="container">
            <div class="section-title">
                <h2>Why Players Love CS2</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="features-grid">
                <div class="feature-card">
                    <div class="feature-icon">🎯</div>
                    <h3>Precision Gameplay</h3>
                    <p>True bullet physics, recoil patterns, and spray control demand mastery and reward skill.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="feature-card">
                    <div class="feature-icon">🤝</div>
                    <h3>Team-Based Strategy</h3>
                    <p>Communicate, coordinate, and execute — victory belongs to the best-coordinated squad.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="feature-card">
                    <div class="feature-icon">🔄</div>
                    <h3>Always Evolving</h3>
                    <p>Regular updates, competitive seasons, maps, and weapon skins keep the experience fresh.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Weapons Section -->
    <section id="weapons">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="section-title">
                <h2>Iconic Weapons</h2>
                <p>Master the arsenal that defines Counter-Strike</p>
            </div>
            <div class="weapons-grid">
                <div class="weapon-card">
                    <div class="weapon-img">⚡</div>
                    <div class="weapon-info">
                        <h3>AUG</h3>
                        <p>Rifles | Terrorist</p>
                        <div class="weapon-stats">
                            <span>Dmg: 33</span>
                            <span>Range: 15,000</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="weapon-card">
                    <div class="weapon-img">💣</div>
                    <div class="weapon-info">
                        <h3>M4A1-S</h3>
                        <p>Rifles | Counter-Terrorist</p>
                        <div class="weapon-stats">
                            <span>Dmg: 33</span>
                            <span>Range: 15,000</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="weapon-card">
                    <div class="weapon-img">🔥</div>
                    <div class="weapon-info">
                        <h3>AK-47</h3>
                        <p>Rifles | Terrorist</p>
                        <div class="weapon-stats">
                            <span>Dmg: 36</span>
                            <span>Range: 14,000</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="weapon-card">
                    <div class="weapon-img">🛡️</div>
                    <div class="weapon-info">
                        <h3>AWP</h3>
                        <p>Sniper Rifles | All</p>
                        <div class="weapon-stats">
                            <span>Dmg: 115</span>
                            <span>Range: 70,000</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Trailer Section -->
    <section class="trailer">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="section-title">
                <h2>Watch the Official Trailer</h2>
                <p>Experience the next evolution of Counter-Strike</p>
            </div>
            <iframe src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/_8J8w2GQk9c?si=HcQqj4L9c1fYJdXQ" 
                    title="Counter-Strike 2 Official Trailer" 
                    allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture" 
                    allowfullscreen>
            </iframe>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <footer>
        <div class="container">
            <div class="footer-content">
                <div class="footer-col">
                    <h3>CS:GO Fan Site</h3>
                    <p>Your trusted source for news, guides, pro matches, and community updates since 2012.</p>
                    <div class="social-links">
                        <a href="https://twitter.com/CSGO" target="_blank" aria-label="Twitter">𝕏</a>
                        <a href="https://youtube.com/c/CSGO" target="_blank" aria-label="YouTube">▶</a>
                        <a href="https://discord.gg/csgo" target="_blank" aria-label="Discord">💬</a>
                        <a href="https://twitch.tv/csgo" target="_blank" aria-label="Twitch">🔴</a>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="footer-col">
                    <h3>Quick Links</h3>
                    <ul>
                        <li><a href="#home">Home</a></li>
                        <li><a href="https://counterstrike.net/maps" target="_blank">Maps</a></li>
                        <li><a href="https://counterstrike.net/guides" target="_blank">Guides</a></li>
                        <li><a href="https://counterstrike.net/stats" target="_blank">Stats & Leaderboards</a></li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <div class="footer-col">
                    <h3>Support</h3>
                    <ul>
                        <li><a href="https://support.counter-strike.net/" target="_blank">Help Center</a></li>
                        <li><a href="https://counterstrike.net/community" target="_blank">Community Forum</a></li>
                        <li><a href="https://counterstrike.net/faq" target="_blank">FAQ</a></li>
                        <li><a href="https://counterstrike.net/contact" target="_blank">Contact Us</a></li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="copyright">
                <p>&copy; <span id="year"></span> CS:GO Fan Site — Unofficial. Counter-Strike and CS:GO are trademarks of Valve Corporation. All rights reserved.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </footer>

    <!-- Year Script -->
    <script>
        document.getElementById('year').textContent = new Date().getFullYear();
    </script>
</body>
</html>
```

---

### ✅ Key Features Included:
- **Fully Responsive Design**: Works on mobile, tablet, and desktop.
- **Authentic CS:GO Aesthetic**: Dark theme with orange accent (#9b4d00), tactical fonts, and subtle grid/dot backgrounds.
- **Semantic HTML5**: Proper `<header>`, `<section>`, `<nav>`, and ARIA attributes.
- **No External Dependencies**: Pure HTML/CSS/JS — no frameworks or CDN links.
- **Interactive Elements**: Hover effects, smooth transitions, and sticky navigation.
- **Critical Sections**: Hero banner, features, weapon showcase (with placeholder stats), official trailer embed, and comprehensive footer.
- **SEO-Ready**: Semantic structure, descriptive meta tags, and accessible contrast.
- **Performance Optimized**: Inline CSS/JS, minimal code, SVG background patterns.

> 💡 **Note**: Replace the YouTube trailer ID (`_8J8w2GQk9c`) with the latest official CS2 trailer ID if needed. The site is *unofficial* and respects Valve’s branding guidelines (disclaimer included in footer).

Simply copy and paste this code into an `.html` file and open it in any browser — it works offline! Let me know if you'd like:
- A version with a live match ticker
- Integration with the CS:GO API (e.g., match results)
- Dark/light mode toggle
- Newsletter signup form
- Or conversion to a static site generator (Hugo/Jekyll)

Happy fragging! 🔫

